ked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Contexto\nReporte de imagen rota en catalogo (screenshot de tiles con imagen en blanco). Auditoria de las 200 fotos del catalogo (`imageUrl`/`images`/variantes en `backend/src/db/seed.ts`) contra los archivos reales en `frontend/public/products` encontro exactamente 2 rotas (198/200 ya resolvian bien, no era regresion de PR #143/#144):\n\n1. `natures-bounty-biotin-10000-mcg-120-rapid-release-softgels`: el `imageUrl` a nivel producto apuntaba a un archivo que nunca existio (`.../natures-bounty-biotin-10000-mcg-120-rapid-release-softgels-1.jpg`) en vez de la foto real de la variante default (pack1).\n2. `dr-bronners-peppermint-pure-castile-soap`: la variante `16oz` referenciaba una 4ta foto (`16fl/4.jpg`) que nunca se genero (solo existen 3).\n\n## Fix\nAmbos corregidos en `seed.ts` + reseed corrido localmente. Ver PR.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kelvinhe04/healthora/issues/147/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kelvinhe04/healthora/issues/147/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93730","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93730/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93730/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93730/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/93730","id":4676194166,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABFrkPdg","number":93730,"title":"[$250] Fullstory - The session is not shown in fullstory for a user created on Prod","user":{"login":"lanitochka17","id":78819774,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE5Nzc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78819774?v=4","gravatar_id":""