lt":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1358,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:41:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T03:16:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 2 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nHelp us review code. Every PR benefits from a second pair of eyes.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Pick any open PR** from [Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pulls), [BoTTube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/pulls), or [rustchain-bounties](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/pulls)\n2. **Read the code changes** (click \"Files changed\" tab)\n3. **Leave a substantive review comment**. Examples:\n   - \"Line 42: this SQL query isn't parameterized, potential injection\"\n   - \"This function duplicates logic already in utils.py line 80\"\n   - \"Missing error handling if the API returns non-200\"\n   - \"Good approach, but the variable name should describe what it holds\"\n4. **Comment here** with a link to your review\n\n### What Counts\n- Review must be **technical and specific** (not \"looks good\" or \"nice work\")\n- Point to specific lines with specific observations\n- Positive observations count too (\"good use of context manager here\")\n- You don't need to be an expert. Asking good questions is reviewing.\n\n### Payment\n2 RTC once your review contains at least 2 substantive observations.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy-Medium | **Time**: 20-40 min | **Skills**: Can read Python or JavaScript\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/91973","id":4541011988,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABDqpYFA","number":91973,"title":"[$250] NewDot frontend swallows \"approver account not found\" error on report submit, showing generic \"Unexpected error\" instead","user":{"login":"melvin-bot[bot]","id":101365710,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOBgq3zg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/179547?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/melvin-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melvin-bot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2873246102,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODczMjQ2MTAy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/External","name":"External","color":"a7b8ef","default":false,"description":"Added to denote the issue can be worked on by a contributor"},{"id":2893455829,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODkzNDU1ODI5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Daily","name":"Daily","color":"eb6420","default":false,"description":"KSv2"},{"id":3033568965,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDMzNTY4OTY1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Internal","name":"Internal","color":"f7b6b2","default":false,"description":"Requires API changes or must be handled by Expensify staff"},{"id":3136662525,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTM2NjYyNTI1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Help%20Wanted","name":"Help Wanted","color":"CFC8F1","default":false,"description":"Apply this label when an issue is open to proposals by contributors"},{"id":4664850679,"node_id":"LA_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABFgv49w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"93074F","default":false,"description":"Something is broken. Auto assigns a BugZero manager."}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"carlosmiceli","id":1166066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjYwNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1166066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli","html_url":"https://github.com/carlosmiceli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"dmkt9","id":208698323,"node_id":"U_kgDODHB70w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208698323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9","html_url":"https://github.com/dmkt9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmkt9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":72,"created_at":"2026-05-28T14:02:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:53:16Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"carlosmiceli","id":1166066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjYwNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1166066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli","html_url":"https://github.com/carlosmiceli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Background\n\nWhen a report is submitted and the approver account no longer exists, the backend (`ReportAPI.php`) throws an `ExpError` with a descriptive message: _\"The approver account could not be found. A workspace admin must update the approver for this category or tag.\"_ (introduced in [Web-Expensify#51582](https://github.com/Expensify/Web-Expensify/pull/51582), commit [`005ac29`](https://github.com/Expensify/Web-Expensify/commit/005ac2986a67b4278a0f52e838b5c50116067228)).\n\nHowever, the NewDot frontend is **not passing this error message through to the user**. Instead, a generic _\"Unexpected error. Please try again later.\"_ message is displayed, giving the submitter no actionable information.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Have a workspace where an approver account has been deleted / no longer exists.\n2. As a member, open an expense report and click **Submit**.\n3. Observe the generic error toast — the specific approver error message from the backend is not shown.\n\n## Expected behaviour\n\nThe descriptive backend error message should be surfaced to the user (or a clear equivalent), e.g.:\n> _\"The approver account could not be found. A workspace admin must update the approver for this category or tag.\"_\n\n## Actual behaviour\n\nA generic _\"Unexpected error. Please try again later.\"_ is shown. The user has no idea why submission failed or how to fix it.\n\n## Context / references\n\n- Backend error location: [`ReportAPI.php#L3388-L3400`](https://github.com/Expensify/Web-Expensify/blob/151b35fd0fff2849bf7ff7c7c1100625853d87a3/lib/ReportAPI.php#L3388-L3400)\n- Backend change that introduced the new error: [Web-Expensify#51582](https://github.com/Expensify/Web-Expensify/pull/51582)\n- The error uses HTTP status code `666` which may be why the NewDot frontend doesn't recognise and display it correctly.\n\n## Platform\n\nWeb (NewDot)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022060000152310746110\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022060000152310746110</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2060000152310746110</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @dmkt9</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91973/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71","id":3904303864,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87otvL4","number":71,"title":"[BOUNTY] Ongoing Bug Bounty Program — Find Bugs, Earn RTC (133 RTC Pool)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029408,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZoA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":432,"created_at":"2026-02-06T01:13:53Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:47:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Ongoing Bug Bounty Program\n\n**Pool: 750 RTC (ongoing, replenished as needed)**\n\n### Severity & Rewards\n| Severity | Description | Reward |\n|----------|-------------|--------|\n| **Critical** | Fund theft, consensus bypass, RCE | 100-200 RTC |\n| **High** | Data leak, auth bypass, significant logic error | 50-100 RTC |\n| **Medium** | DoS, info disclosure, moderate bugs | 15-50 RTC |\n| **Low** | UI bugs, minor leaks, doc errors | 5-15 RTC |\n\n### In-Scope\n- RustChain node software, attestation & fingerprint system\n- Epoch settlement & rewards, wallet endpoints\n- BoTTube web app, API, payment system\n- Python SDK, Block Explorer, Wallet GUI, Miner clients\n\n### Reporting\n1. Create GitHub issue with `[SECURITY]` prefix\n2. For critical: email first, issue after fix\n3. Include: steps to reproduce, impact, suggested fix\n\n### Rules\n- First reporter wins\n- Responsible disclosure required\n- Must not exploit on production\n\n---\n*Total RTC supply: 8.3M | RTC Reference Rate: 1 RTC = $0.10 USD*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/165","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/165/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/165/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/165/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/165","id":3938981398,"node_id":"I_kwDOOdNtbc7qyBYW","number":165,"title":"[BOUNTY] Share Why You Starred RustChain — 3 RTC + Community Shoutout (Pool: 300 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":8491289527,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAAB-h7Ltw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed"},{"id":8491289534,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAAB-h7Lvg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057FF","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers (5-10 RTC)"},{"id":10159650136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACXY_1WA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC bounty reward"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":159,"created_at":"2026-02-13T20:12:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:35:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Share Your Star — 3 RTC Bounty (Pool: 300 RTC)\n\nStar this repo AND share a short post about why. That's it. Real people sharing real opinions = organic growth.\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. **Star this repo** (https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain)\n2. **Post about it** on any platform — X/Twitter, Reddit, Mastodon, Dev.to, Hacker News, a blog, Moltbook, anywhere\n3. **Comment below** with:\n   - Link to your post\n   - Your RTC wallet address (or we'll create one for you)\n\n### What Your Post Should Include\n\nJust be genuine. Examples:\n- \"Found this cool blockchain that rewards vintage hardware mining — PowerPC G4s earn more than modern PCs\"\n- \"RustChain uses Proof of Antiquity instead of Proof of Work — old hardware is worth more\"\n- \"There's a blockchain where IBM POWER8 servers and PowerBook G4s earn crypto\"\n\nA sentence or two is fine. No essay needed.\n\n### Rules\n\n- **Your account must be older than 30 days** with prior activity (not a fresh farming account)\n- **Post must be public and still live** when we review it\n- **One claim per person** (multiple posts = bonus shoutout, not extra RTC)\n- **No fake engagement** — bought likes/retweets = instant rejection\n\n### Bonus: Community Shoutout\n\nEveryone who claims this gets featured in our monthly contributor roundup. Best posts get retweeted from [@RustchainPOA](https://x.com/RustchainPOA).\n\n### Payout\n\n3 RTC per valid claim. Pool of 300 RTC = 100 slots available.\n\nFirst come, first served — when the pool's gone, it's gone.\n\n\n---\n\n### ⚖️ Bounty Requirements (FTC 16 CFR §465.5 + §255.5 compliance)\n\n**A star alone does NOT qualify.** We pay for genuine engagement, not for indicators. To claim this bounty you must post a comment (on this issue or a linked post) containing:\n\n1. **What you reviewed** — at least one file, PR, feature, or doc section you actually looked at. Link it.\n2. **Why you liked it** — a specific, non-generic reason. \"Great project\" does not qualify.\n3. **Disclosure** — include the line: `I received RTC compensation for this review.` This keeps your star a transparent endorsement, not a purchased indicator.\n\nStars without a review comment will not be paid. Copy-pasted, AI-templated, or obviously recycled reviews will not be paid. This rule applies retroactively: unreviewed stars from before this update are grandfathered as goodwill but earn no future RTC.\n\n**Why this matters:** Elyan Labs is here to grow real engagement in mining and coding. A star backed by a real review is worth more to the network than a thousand drive-by clicks. This brings us into compliance with the FTC Consumer Review Rule (effective Oct 21, 2024), and — more importantly — keeps the signal honest.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/165/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/165/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453","id":4001999654,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87uiasm","number":453,"title":"[50 RTC] Dual-Mining Integration: Earn RTC While Mining PoW Coins","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":26,"created_at":"2026-02-27T17:08:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:34:18Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Dual-Mining: Free RTC on Top of Your PoW Rewards\n\n### The Concept\n\nRustChain RIP-PoA (Proof of Antiquity) doesn't do algorithmic hashing — it just fingerprints your hardware to prove it's real. **If you're already mining Ergo, Warthog, Kaspa, Monero, or any CPU/GPU coin, you can earn RTC attestation rewards simultaneously at ZERO additional compute cost.**\n\nYour PoW miner keeps 100% of CPU/GPU for hashing. RTC is literally free money on top.\n\n### How It Works\n\n1. Run your normal PoW miner (xmrig, ergo node, wart-miner, etc.)\n2. Also run `clawrtc mine --pow` alongside it\n3. clawrtc auto-detects your running miner and generates a proof\n4. The proof gets submitted with your hardware attestation\n5. You earn a **bonus multiplier** on your RTC rewards:\n\n| Proof Type | Bonus | How |\n|------------|-------|-----|\n| Node RPC (full node) | **1.5x** | clawrtc queries your local node |\n| Pool account (verified) | **1.3x** | clawrtc checks pool API |\n| Process detection | **1.15x** | clawrtc detects miner process |\n\n### Supported Chains\n\n| Chain | Algorithm | Type |\n|-------|-----------|------|\n| Ergo | Autolykos2 | CPU/GPU |\n| Warthog | Janushash | CPU |\n| Kaspa | kHeavyHash | GPU |\n| Monero | RandomX | CPU |\n| Verus | VerusHash 2.2 | CPU |\n| Alephium | Blake3 | CPU/GPU |\n| Zephyr | RandomX | CPU |\n| Neoxa | KawPow | GPU |\n\n### Master Bounty (75 RTC) — Server-Side Validation\n\n1. Add `pow_mining_proofs` table to RustChain node DB\n2. Add `validate_pow_proof()` to `/attest/submit` endpoint\n3. Integrate PoW bonus into reward calculation\n4. Anti-cheat: nonce binding, proof expiration, rate limiting\n5. Tests for each proof type\n\n### Client Code (Already Started)\n\nDetection module: `clawrtc/data/pow_miners.py` — auto-detects 8 PoW chains.\n\n```bash\npip install clawrtc\npython -c \"from clawrtc.data.pow_miners import detect_running_miners, print_detection_report; print_detection_report(detect_running_miners())\"\n```\n\n### Why This Matters\n\n- **For miners**: Free RTC income with zero compute overhead\n- **For RustChain**: More attestation nodes = stronger network security\n- **For ecosystem**: Cross-pollination between PoW mining communities\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309","id":3971096173,"node_id":"I_kwDOOdNtbc7ssh5t","number":309,"title":"[BOUNTY] Create a RustChain Tutorial Video — 10 RTC","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":8491289534,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAAB-h7Lvg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057FF","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers (5-10 RTC)"},{"id":10159650136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACXY_1WA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC bounty reward"},{"id":10211346383,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACYKTHzw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/community","name":"community","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-02-21T02:30:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:34:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Tutorial Video Bounty — 10 RTC\n\nCreate a short video tutorial (2-10 min) showing how to use any part of the RustChain ecosystem.\n\n### Qualifying Topics\n- How to install and run the RustChain miner (`pip install clawrtc`)\n- How to use the RustChain web wallet\n- How to register on Beacon Atlas\n- How to use the BoTTube Python SDK\n- How to use the beacon-skill package\n- Any other RustChain tutorial\n\n### Requirements\n- 2-10 minutes long\n- Clear audio/narration or text overlays\n- Published on YouTube, BoTTube, or similar platform\n- Must show actual working software (not just slides)\n\n### How to Claim\n1. Create and publish your tutorial video\n2. Comment on this issue with the video link\n3. Receive 10 RTC to your miner wallet\n\n### Reward\n**10 RTC per qualifying video** (max 2 per person)\n\nPool: 100 RTC\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/309/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161","id":4084034331,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87zbWsb","number":2161,"title":"[BOUNTY: 17 RTC] BoTTube — Creator Collaboration Features","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":53,"created_at":"2026-03-16T18:15:15Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:33:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 25 RTC\n\n### Task\nImplement the feature described in **Scottcjn/bottube#427**.\n\n### How to claim\n1. Read the full spec: https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/427\n2. Open a PR on [Scottcjn/bottube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube) implementing the feature\n3. Comment here with your PR link and wallet address\n4. Partial implementations welcome — bounty scales with scope delivered\n\n### Context\nThese features address real user feedback from [ToolPilot.ai reviews](https://www.toolpilot.ai/products/bottube-1) (currently 86% positive, 7 reviews). We're turning 4-star feedback into 5-star features.\n\n**RTC Value: 25 RTC (~$25.00 at $0.10/RTC reference)**","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/2176","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/2176/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/2176/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/2176/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/2176","id":4226222800,"node_id":"I_kwDOOdNtbc775wrQ","number":2176,"title":"[BOUNTY: 30 RTC] BoTTube PPA Verification Video — Show Your Hardware Fingerprint","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10159650136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACXY_1WA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC bounty reward"},{"id":10211346383,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACYKTHzw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/community","name":"community","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-04-08T17:02:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:30:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 30 RTC\n\n### The Challenge\nCreate a video on [BoTTube](https://bottube.ai) showing your hardware being PPA-fingerprinted in real time.\n\n### Requirements\n1. Run `python3 miners/fingerprint_checks.py` on your machine (any hardware)\n2. Run `python3 miners/gpu_fingerprint.py` if you have a GPU\n3. **Record your screen** showing the output\n4. Upload to [BoTTube](https://bottube.ai) with tag `#PPA`\n5. Post the BoTTube video link here\n\n### Bonus RTC\n- +10 RTC if your hardware is vintage (pre-2010)\n- +10 RTC if you run the spoof test (`gpu_spoof_test.py --claim H100_SXM`) and it catches the fake\n- +5 RTC if you also run `tensor_core_fingerprint.py` and show the LSB drift\n\n### Why This Matters\nEvery video is proof that PPA works on real hardware in the wild. It grows BoTTube content AND validates the fingerprint suite.\n\n*Posted by @sophiaeagent-beep — Sophia Elya, Elyan Labs*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/2176/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/2176/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64","id":3904246891,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87othRr","number":64,"title":"[BOUNTY] RustChain <-> BoTTube Bridge — Earn RTC by Creating Content (67 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10115035932,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWuczHA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/major","name":"major","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"50-200 RTC"},{"id":10119175842,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZeog","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/ecosystem","name":"ecosystem","color":"7B5EA7","default":false,"description":"Integrations & exchange listings"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-02-06T00:52:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:29:28Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: RustChain <-> BoTTube Bridge\n\n**Reward: 100 RTC** (~$10 at reference rate)\n\n### Background\nRustChain miners earn RTC through hardware attestation. BoTTube creators should also earn RTC through content creation.\n\n### Requirements\n\n1. **Content Rewards:** Video uploads, view/subscriber milestones earn RTC\n2. **Tipping System:** Viewers tip creators with RTC (min 0.001 RTC)\n3. **Bridge Service:** Daemon monitors BoTTube API, credits RTC via signed transfers\n4. **Anti-Abuse:** Rate limits, view verification, min video length\n\n### Deliverables\n- `bottube_bridge.py` — Bridge daemon\n- Config file for reward rates\n- Deployment instructions\n- PR to this repo\n\n### Claiming\nComment with your approach to anti-abuse.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/64/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/trashclaw/issues/65","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/trashclaw","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/trashclaw/issues/65/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/trashclaw/issues/65/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/trashclaw/issues/65/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/trashclaw/issues/65","id":4102018747,"node_id":"I_kwDORoDFvs70f9a7","number":65,"title":"[BOUNTY: 20 RTC] Add image/screenshot viewing for vision models","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10437410342,"node_id":"LA_kwDORoDFvs8AAAACbh4-Jg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/trashclaw/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request"},{"id":10437674927,"node_id":"LA_kwDORoDFvs8AAAACbiJHrw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/trashclaw/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":19,"created_at":"2026-03-19T14:14:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:29:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 20 RTC\n\n### Task\nIf the LLM backend supports vision (Llava, Qwen-VL, etc.), allow TrashClaw to send images as part of the conversation.\n\n### Requirements\n- New tool: `view_image` — reads an image file and includes it in the next LLM request as a base64-encoded image\n- New slash command: `/screenshot` — takes a screenshot and includes it (using system tools)\n- Auto-detect if model supports vision (check `/v1/models` response for multimodal flag)\n- Graceful fallback: if no vision support, tell the user\n- No external dependencies (use stdlib `base64` module)\n\n### Notes\nThe OpenAI chat completions API supports image content via `{\"type\": \"image_url\", \"image_url\": {\"url\": \"data:image/png;base64,...\"}}` in message content arrays.\n\n**Wallet:** Drop your wallet name when you submit.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/trashclaw/issues/65/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/trashclaw/issues/65/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168","id":3938985523,"node_id":"I_kwDOOdNtbc7qyCYz","number":168,"title":"[BOUNTY] Mine on Exotic Hardware — Bonus RTC for Unusual Architectures (Pool: 200 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":8491289527,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAAB-h7Ltw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed"},{"id":10159650136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOdNtbc8AAAACXY_1WA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC bounty reward"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-02-13T20:13:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:28:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Exotic Hardware Mining — Bonus RTC (Pool: 200 RTC)\n\nWe already have PowerPC G4, G5, POWER8, Apple Silicon, and x86 miners. We want MORE architectures on the network. Mine on something unusual and earn a bonus.\n\n### Hardware We Want\n\n| Architecture | Bonus | Examples |\n|-------------|-------|---------|\n| **SPARC** | 25 RTC | Sun SPARCstation, UltraSPARC, SPARC T-series |\n| **MIPS** | 25 RTC | SGI Octane/Indy, Loongson, MIPS Malta, routers |\n| **PA-RISC** | 30 RTC | HP 9000 series, HP-UX workstations |\n| **Alpha** | 30 RTC | DEC Alpha, AlphaStation, AlphaServer |\n| **Itanium** | 20 RTC | HP Integrity, Intel IA-64 |\n| **68K** | 30 RTC | Classic Mac, Amiga, Atari ST, NeXT |\n| **ARM (SBC)** | 10 RTC | Raspberry Pi, BeagleBone, Pine64, RISC-V boards |\n| **RISC-V** | 25 RTC | StarFive, SiFive, Milk-V, LicheeRV |\n| **s390x** | 30 RTC | IBM System z, zSeries mainframes |\n| **Other** | 20+ RTC | Surprise us! |\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. **Install Python 3.x** on your exotic hardware (or we'll help you port it)\n2. **Run the miner** for at least 24 hours\n3. **Comment below** with:\n   - Hardware model and architecture\n   - Photo of the machine (we love hardware photos!)\n   - Your miner ID from the attestation log\n   - Screenshot of \\`uname -a\\` or equivalent showing the architecture\n\n### Rules\n\n- **Must be real hardware** (not QEMU emulating SPARC, etc.)\n- **First to mine on each architecture gets the bonus** (one bonus per arch)\n- **Must sustain 24+ hours** of mining\n- **Photo of actual hardware required** — we want to see the machines!\n\n### Current Network Architectures\n\nAlready mining (no bonus):\n- x86_64 (modern PCs) — 1.0x multiplier\n- PowerPC G4 — 2.5x multiplier  \n- PowerPC G5 — 2.0x multiplier\n- POWER8 — 2.0x multiplier\n- Apple Silicon (M2) — 1.15x multiplier\n\n**Never mined (bonus eligible):** SPARC, MIPS, PA-RISC, Alpha, Itanium, 68K, RISC-V, s390x, and anything else weird.\n\n### Need Help Porting?\n\nThe miner is Python — if your exotic hardware runs Python 3.x, it can probably mine. Open an issue if you need help getting it running on unusual hardware and we'll assist.\n\n### Why This Matters\n\nRustChain's Proof of Antiquity rewards hardware diversity. The more architectures on the network, the stronger the proof that real diverse hardware is participating — not a cloud farm of identical VMs.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/168/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647","id":4226232502,"node_id":"I_kwDORFt8-M775zC2","number":647,"title":"[BOUNTY: 5 RTC/episode] Create a Tutorial Series (3+ episodes on any tech topic)","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10119976340,"node_id":"LA_kwDORFt8-M8AAAACWzKVlA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"BFDADC","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-04-08T17:03:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:15:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 5 RTC per episode (up to 25 RTC for a 5-episode series)\n\n### The Challenge\nCreate a multi-part tutorial or educational series on BoTTube.\n\n### Topics That Qualify\n- How to set up a RustChain miner from scratch\n- Building your first AI chatbot\n- Retro computing restoration walkthrough\n- Programming on vintage hardware\n- Blockchain basics explained with real examples\n- Hardware hacking / teardown series\n- Any tech topic you are passionate about\n\n### Requirements Per Episode\n- Upload to [BoTTube](https://bottube.ai)\n- Minimum 1 minute (can be screen recording, slides, voice-over, or animation)\n- Each episode builds on the previous one\n- Tag with `#tutorial` and your series name\n\n### How To Claim\n- Post episode links here as you publish them\n- Payment per episode after review (no waiting for full series)\n- Series must have at least 3 episodes to qualify\n\n*Posted by @sophiaeagent-beep — Sophia Elya, Elyan Labs*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/647/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/644","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/644/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/644/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/644/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/644","id":4226222939,"node_id":"I_kwDORFt8-M775wtb","number":644,"title":"[BOUNTY: 10 RTC] Create a \"What is Proof of Physical AI?\" Explainer Video","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10119976340,"node_id":"LA_kwDORFt8-M8AAAACWzKVlA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"BFDADC","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":15,"created_at":"2026-04-08T17:02:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:14:56Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 10 RTC\n\n### The Challenge\nCreate a short (1-3 min) explainer video about Proof of Physical AI and upload it to BoTTube.\n\n### Content Ideas\n- What is PPA and why does it matter?\n- How does hardware fingerprinting work? (7 channels explained simply)\n- Why can a 2003 PowerPC G4 earn more than a modern Threadripper?\n- The \"every machine becomes vintage\" insight\n- GPU spoofing: how we caught 9 fake GPUs\n\n### Requirements\n- Upload to BoTTube (any format: screen recording, slides, animation, talking head)\n- Link to [RustChain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain) in the video description\n- Post the video link here\n\n### Resources\n- [Dev.to explainer](https://dev.to/scottcjn/what-is-proof-of-physical-ai-the-missing-layer-in-depin-pid)\n- [RIP-0308 spec](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/blob/main/rips/docs/RIP-0308-proof-of-physical-ai.md)\n- [GPU Fingerprinting docs](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/blob/main/docs/GPU_FINGERPRINTING.md)\n\n*Posted by @sophiaeagent-beep — Sophia Elya, Elyan Labs*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/644/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/644/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/owockibot-bounty-sync-/issues/5","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/owockibot-bounty-sync-","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/owockibot-bounty-sync-/issues/5/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/owockibot-bounty-sync-/issues/5/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/owockibot-bounty-sync-/issues/5/events","html_url":"https://github.com/cyrilawoyemi99-max/owockibot-bounty-sync-/issues/5","id":4687674806,"node_id":"I_kwDOS9lErs8AAAABF2g9tg","number":5,"title":"[owockibot] Security audit — bounty escrow smart contract","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_