expensify.slack.com/archives/C049HHMV9SM/p1781260400701829)\n\n## Action Performed:\n\n1. Navigate to Workspace > Company Cards.\n2. Create a new CSV Import card feed.\n3. Upload a spreadsheet containing card transaction data with columns such as: Card Last 4, Spender, Merchant, Transaction Currency, Total Amount,  (Missing: Date column)\n4. Complete the import process.\n5. Open the newly created card feed.\n\n## Expected Result:\nThe import process should validate required fields (including Date, if mandatory).\nIf a required column is missing, the system should:\nDisplay a clear validation error, and/or\nPrevent feed creation until the file is corrected.\nIf the file is valid, cards should appear in the feed after import.\n## Actual Result:\nThe CSV feed is created successfully.\nNo cards are added to the feed.\nThe feed displays: “No cards in this feed”\nNo validation error or warning is shown indicating that required data (e.g., Date column) is missing.\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n## Platforms:\nSelect the officially supported platforms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8207f02b-9dc0-4239-ba55-f7d0918299ba\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022066883484768848009\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022066883484768848009</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2066883484768848009</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-30</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93704/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"ro