lor":"93074F","default":false,"description":"Something is broken. Auto assigns a BugZero manager."}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"aimane-chnaif","id":96077027,"node_id":"U_kgDOBboE4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96077027?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif","html_url":"https://github.com/aimane-chnaif","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":41,"created_at":"2026-06-22T07:14:25Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T21:48:28Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"aimane-chnaif","id":96077027,"node_id":"U_kgDOBboE4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96077027?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif","html_url":"https://github.com/aimane-chnaif","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.4.16-1\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://test-management.browserstack.com/projects/2219752/folder/13176908/test-cases/73685192\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** -\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Regression TC Execution\n**Device used:** Xiaomi RedMi Note 10 / Android 12\n**App Component:** Other\n\n## Action Performed:\nPrecondition: workspace with enabled Accounting feature.\n\n1. Go to workspace > Accounting \n2. Tap on QuickBooks Online > Connect\n\n## Expected Result:\nNew tab opens to enter QBO credentials\n\n## Actual Result:\nBlank tab opens with Autoformatting checkbox\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93919dfe-8dd9-4d8a-86e2-f42dfca2359c\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Mita Rachim\n> Bug ID: 7187012\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022068957073168668976\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022068957073168668976</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2068957073168668976</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-06</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94142/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94142/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gitlawb/node/issues/160","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gitlawb/node","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gitlawb/node/issues/160/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gitlawb/node/issues/160/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gitlawb/node/issues/160/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Gitlawb/node/issues/160","id":4822979866,"node_id":"I_kwDOSPq2nc8AAAABH3jVGg","number":160,"title":"claim_bounty leaks private-repo metadata and locks the bounty — no repo-read gate (write-side of #120)","user":{"login":"beardthelion","id":56458543,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDU4NTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56458543?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beardthelion","html_url":"https://github.com/beardthelion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beardthelion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beardthelion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beardthelion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beardthelion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beardthelion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beardthelion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beardthelion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beardthelion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beardthelion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11304622434,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSPq2nc8AAAACoc7ZYg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gitlawb/node/labels/kind:security","name":"kind:security","color":"1d76db","default":false,"description":"Vulnerability fix or hardening"},{"id":11304622586,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSPq2nc8AAAACoc7Z-g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gitlawb/node/labels/crate:node","name":"crate:node","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"gitlawb-node — the serving node and REST API"},{"id":11304622774,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSPq2nc8AAAACoc7atg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gitlawb/node/labels/subsystem:visibility","name":"subsystem:visibility","color":"006b75","default":false,"description":"Path-scoped visibility and content withholding"},{"id":11304623032,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSPq2nc8AAAACoc7buA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gitlawb/node/labels/subsystem:api","name":"subsystem:api","color":"006b75","default":false,"description":"Node REST API request/response surface"},{"id":11304623070,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSPq2nc8AAAACoc7b3g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gitlawb/node/labels/sev:high","name":"sev:high","color":"d93f0b","default":false,"description":"Major break or real security/trust risk, no easy workaround"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-06T20:46:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T21:00:34Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\n\n`POST /api/v1/bounties/{id}/claim` (`claim_bounty`, `crates/gitlawb-node/src/api/bounties.rs`) resolves a bounty by its global id and returns the full `BountyRecord` to any authenticated agent, with no `authorize_repo_read` on the bounty's repo. Its only precondition is `status == \"open\"` (bounties.rs:171). So an agent who is neither the owner nor a permitted reader of a **private** repo can claim that repo's open bounty and receive `repo_owner`, `repo_name`, `title`, `issue_id`, and `creator_did` — and, as a side effect, becomes `claimant_did` and flips the bounty to `claimed`, locking it against the legitimate claimant.\n\nThis is the write-side sibling of #120. #157 gates the read surfaces (`get_bounty`, `list_all_bounties`, `list_repo_bounties`); once that lands, `claim_bounty` is the remaining ungated path to a private bounty's metadata, and the only one that also mutates state.\n\n## Scope\n\nOnly `claim_bounty`. The other mutations enforce a `did_matches` creator/claimant check before returning the record, so they don't disclose to an outsider:\n- `submit_bounty` — claimant-only (bounties.rs:213-219)\n- `approve_bounty` — creator-only (bounties.rs:253-257)\n- `cancel_bounty` — creator-only (bounties.rs:300-304)\n- `dispute_bounty` — creator-or-claimant (bounties.rs:338-347)\n\n`create_bounty` already gates via `authorize_repo_read` (bounties.rs:84). The route group `bounty_write_routes` requires a signature (`require_signature`), i.e. any authenticated agent, not the repo owner/reader.\n\n## Reproduction (executed)\n\nSeed a private repo + an open bounty on it, then have a different authenticated DID `POST /api/v1/bounties/{id}/claim`:\n\n```\nstatus=200\n{\"repo_owner\":\"did:key:zCLAIMOWNER…\",\"repo_name\":\"secret-repo\",\"issue_id\":\"SECRET-ISSUE\",\n \"title\":\"SECRET-TITLE\",\"creator_did\":\"did:key:zCLAIMOWNER…\",\"status\":\"claimed\",\n \"claimant_did\":\"did:key:zCLAIMSTRANGER…\", …}\n```\n\nThe stranger is neither owner nor reader; they get the private repo's owner/name/title and have locked the bounty.\n\n## Fix (verified)\n\nAfter resolving the bounty and before the status check, authorize the caller against the bounty's repo, mirroring `create_bounty` (bounties.rs:84):\n\n```rust\ncrate::api::authorize_repo_read(&state, &bounty.repo_owner, &bounty.repo_name, Some(auth.0.as_str()), \"/\").await?;\n```\n\n`authorize_repo_read` returns `RepoNotFound` (404) on deny, so a non-reader gets the same 404 as a missing bounty (no existence oracle). With this in place, the stranger claim above returns 404 with no body, while the repo owner claiming their own bounty still returns 200 (verified).\n\nAdd a deny test (non-reader claiming an open bounty on a private repo → 404) plus an owner-admit test. Note the `authz_guard` drift test can't catch this class — it keys on `Path<(owner, repo)>` and `claim_bounty` is a global-id handler.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gitlawb/node/issues/160/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gitlawb/node/issues/160/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94335","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94335/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94335/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94335/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/94335","id":4727622895,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABGcnM7w","number":94335,"title":"[$250] Error is not shown for the empty Quantity field after choose another subrate","user":{"login":"applause-bot[bot]","id":265651874,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOD9WGog