 and upload an Excel/CSV file with subrates to the workspace's Per Diem settings\n\n1. Navigate to the workspace chat\n2. Create a new Per Diem expense\n3. Select a subrate from the picker\nVerify that after selecting a subrate, the Quantity text input receives focus automatically and no errors appear when going back from the subrates screen\n4. Without filling in the Quantity, open the subrates screen again and choose another subrate\n\n## Expected Result:\nVerify that this time an error is shown for the empty Quantity field.\n\n## Actual Result:\nThe error is not shown for the empty Quantity field after choose another subrate.\nNote:\n- The error will appear on the third time and so on\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06d2740a-4401-4ea2-a15b-44b47f91bf70\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Murugesan Natarajan\n> Bug ID: 7188422\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022069456754040220007\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022069456754040220007</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2069456754040220007</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-30</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94335/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94335/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94550