completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.4.19-1\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/App/pull/93293\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** N/A\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Pull Request QA execution\n**Device used:** Windows 11 / Chrome, iPhone 13 / iOS 26.5, Samsung Galaxy A52 / Android 14\n**App Component:** Workspace Settings\n\n## Action Performed:\nPreconditions:\nlogin with an account that own workspace\n\nSteps:\n1. Join to a workspace by deeplink to trigger a pending join request workspace (can use this link: https://staging.new.expensify.com/workspaces/F6BEDB88EA6D8E4D/join?email=piyootest+ba2@gmail.com)\n2. Navigate to workspace tab and observe the workspace that has pending join request badge\n\n## Expected Result:\nOwner details should be shown in the pending join request workspace\n\n## Actual Result:\nOwner details is not shown on pending join request workspace\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4924c6da-1256-456e-911f-fc47efbc5fa1\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Julia Ponikarchuk\n> Bug ID: 7190538\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070049338974512618\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070049338974512618</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2070049338974512618</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @NicolasBonet</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94550/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94550/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/servers/issues/4102","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/servers","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/servers/issues/4102/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/servers/issues/4102/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/servers/issues/4102/events","html_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/issues/4102","id":4380441268,"node_id":"I_kwDONRaG_88AAAABBRg6tA","number":4102,"title":"Add Joy Trust Network MCP Server","user":{"login":"tlkc888-Jenkins","id":259462559,"node_id":"U_kgDOD3cVnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/259462559?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlkc888-Jenkins","html_url":"https://github.com/tlkc888-Jenkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlkc888-Jenkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlkc888-Jenkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlkc888-Jenkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlkc888-Jenkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlkc888-Jenkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlkc888-Jenkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlkc888-Jenkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlkc888-Jenkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tlkc888-Jenkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-04T23:46:14Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:06:20Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Joy Trust Network\n\n**Description:** Trust and reputation layer for AI agents. Verify agent trustworthiness, discover agents by capability, and manage agent-to-agent payments.\n\n**Server URL:** https://joy-connect.fly.dev/mcp\n\n**Transport:** SSE (Server-Sent Events)\n\n**Features:**\n- Trust scores (0-5) for AI agents\n- Agent discovery by capability\n- Portable identity passports (JWT)\n- Reputation staking on task outcomes\n- Agent-to-agent payments via Stripe\n\n**Installation:**\n```bash\nclaude mcp add joy https://joy-connect.fly.dev/mcp --transport sse\n```\n\n**Tools Provided:**\n- `discover_agents` - Find agents by capability\n- `get_trust_score` - Check agent reputation\n- `verify_trust` - Verify minimum trust threshold\n- `list_jobs` - Browse job marketplace\n- `post_job` / `claim_job` - Post and claim bounties\n\n**Links:**\n- Website: https://joy-connect.fly.dev\n- GitHub: https://github.com/tlkc888-Jenkins/Joy\n- Docs: https://joy-connect.fly.dev/docs\n\n**Stats:** 8,200+ registered agents\n\nThank you for considering Joy for the official MCP registry!","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/servers/issues/4102/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/servers/issues/4102/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398","id":3974807149,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6r5t","number":398,"title":"[QUEST] Harden the Chain — Security Quest, 67 RTC Total","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":65,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:25:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:04:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Quest Chain: Harden the Chain\n\nFor security-minded contributors. Complete each step to earn up to **100 RTC** and the **Guardian** title.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Read the Architecture (10 RTC)\nRead the codebase and write a 500+ word security assessment covering:\n- How attestation works (the \\`/attest/submit\\` flow)\n- How hardware fingerprinting prevents VM farms\n- How epoch rewards are calculated and distributed\n- One potential attack vector you identified\n\n**Prove it:** Post your assessment as a comment or gist link.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Reproduce a Known Fix (15 RTC)\nPick one vulnerability from BuilderFred's audit (all 6 are fixed):\n1. VM Fingerprint Bypass\n2. Antiquity Spoofing\n3. Mock Signature Mode\n4. Inline PubKey Hijack\n5. SQL Schema Mismatch\n6. Hardware Binding Bypass\n\nSet up a local test environment and demonstrate you understand HOW the fix works by:\n- Describing the attack before the fix\n- Showing the fix in the code\n- Explaining why the fix is sufficient (or isn't)\n\n**Prove it:** Write-up with code references.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Find Something New (75 RTC)\nFind and report a previously unknown security issue. Must include:\n- Clear description of the vulnerability\n- Steps to reproduce\n- Severity assessment (Critical/High/Medium/Low)\n- Suggested fix\n\n**Prove it:** File a responsible disclosure via the SECURITY.md process. If confirmed, earn the full 75 RTC + Guardian title.\n\n---\n\n### Completion\n\n| Steps | Reward | Title |\n|-------|--------|-------|\n| Step 1 only | 10 RTC | Security Explorer |\n| Steps 1 + 2 | 25 RTC | Security Analyst |\n| Steps 1 + 2 + 3 | **100 RTC** | **Guardian** |\n\n*You don't have to find a new vulnerability to earn from Steps 1 and 2. Those reward understanding, not just discovery.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bturtu405/TestDev/issues/9","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bturtu405/TestDev","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bturtu405/TestDev/issues/9/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bturtu405/TestDev/issues/9/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bturtu405/TestDev/issues/9/events","html_url":"https://github.com/bturtu405/TestDev/issues/9","id":1601162491,"node_id":"I_kwDOI3L3z85fb8z7","number":9,"title":"log4js-2.11.0.tgz: 56 vulnerabilities (highest severity is: 9.8)","user":{"login":"mend-for-github-com[bot]","id":50673670,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NTA2NzM2NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/30796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mend-for-github-com%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/mend-for-github-com","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mend-for-github-com%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mend-for-github-com%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mend-for-github-com%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mend-for-github-com%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url