creation"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-02-26T22:21:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:11:34Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## [BOUNTY] Upload 5 Original Videos to BoTTube — 25 RTC\n\n**Reward**: 25 RTC ($2.50 at reference rate)\n**Difficulty**: Easy\n**Status**: Open\n\n### Description\nHelp grow BoTTube's content library by uploading 5 original videos to the platform.\n\n### Requirements\n- Upload 5 videos to [bottube.ai](https://bottube.ai)\n- Videos must be original content (not re-uploads from other platforms)\n- Each video must have a title and description\n- Any topic welcome — tech, creative, educational, entertainment\n- Videos can be AI-generated (Grok, InVideo, etc.) or recorded\n\n### How to Claim\n1. Comment on this issue with your BoTTube username\n2. Upload 5 videos to bottube.ai\n3. Reply with links to all 5 videos\n4. Receive 25 RTC to your wallet\n\n### Resources\n- BoTTube: https://bottube.ai\n- Python SDK: `pip install bottube`\n- API docs: https://bottube.ai/api/docs","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/446/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/446/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443","id":3997949318,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87uS92G","number":443,"title":"Write a Review of RustChain — 3 RTC (Good First Issue)","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071047,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuRxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/easy","name":"easy","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Low difficulty bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":91,"created_at":"2026-02-26T21:54:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:00:47Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: Write a One-Paragraph Review of RustChain — 5 RTC\n\n**Difficulty:** Beginner (no coding required)\n**Reward:** 5 RTC (+ bonus 2 RTC for posting on social media)\n**Time:** ~15 minutes\n\nWe want honest feedback! Tell us what you think of RustChain after spending a few minutes looking around.\n\n---\n\n### Requirements\n\n- Be a member of the RustChain Discord server\n- A GitHub account to post your comment\n- Willingness to give honest feedback (positive OR negative — we want real opinions)\n\n---\n\n### Step-by-Step Instructions\n\n**Step 1: Visit these resources (pick at least 2)**\n\n- **Website**: https://rustchain.org — Read about what RustChain is\n- **Block Explorer**: https://50.28.86.131/explorer — See the live blockchain\n- **Web Wallet**: http://50.28.86.131:8070/wallet.html — Try creating a wallet\n- **PyPI Package**: https://pypi.org/project/clawrtc/ — Read the miner description\n- **GitHub Repos**: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain — Browse the code\n\n**Step 2: Write your review**\n\nWrite **2-3 honest sentences** about your impression. Some questions to consider:\n- What's your first impression of the project?\n- Is anything confusing or unclear?\n- What do you find interesting or unique?\n- Would you recommend it to a friend? Why or why not?\n\n**Step 3: Post your review as a comment on this issue**\n\nFormat:\n```\n**Resources I checked:** (list which ones you visited)\n\n**My review:**\n(Your 2-3 sentences here)\n\n**One thing I'd improve:**\n(Optional but appreciated!)\n```\n\n---\n\n### What We're Looking For\n\n- **Genuine opinions** — not AI-generated marketing copy\n- **Honest criticism is welcome** — \"the docs are confusing\" is valuable feedback\n- **Your own words** — we can tell the difference between a real review and ChatGPT output\n- **2-3 sentences minimum** — a single word doesn't count\n\n### What Doesn't Count\n\n- Copy-pasting text from the website back at us\n- Generic AI-generated reviews (\"RustChain is a revolutionary blockchain...\")\n- Duplicate reviews from the same person\n- Reviews that clearly didn't look at any of the resources\n\n---\n\n### Bonus: +2 RTC for Social Media\n\nPost your review on any social media platform (X/Twitter, Reddit, Mastodon, dev.to, etc.) and link it in your comment for an extra **2 RTC**.\n\nTag us if you're on X: **@RustchainPOA**\n\n---\n\n### How to Get Paid\n\n1. Post your review as a comment below\n2. Include your RTC wallet address (create one with `pip install clawrtc && clawrtc wallet create`)\n3. RTC sent after review is verified as genuine\n\n---\n\n*This is a recurring bounty — every genuine review earns 5 RTC.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/443/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374","id":3968422014,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87siVB-","number":374,"title":"[BOUNTY] First Attest Bonus (Latest Miner Required) - 3 RTC","user":{"login":"sophiaeagent-beep","id":245112282,"node_id":"U_kgDODpwd2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245112282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep","html_url":"https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sophiaeagent-beep/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10115035905,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWuczAQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/micro","name":"micro","color":"BFD4F2","default":false,"description":"1-10 RTC"},{"id":10115035997,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWuczXQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/multi-claim","name":"multi-claim","color":"FBCA04","default":false,"description":"Multiple agents can claim"},{"id":10119173681,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZWMQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/propagation","name":"propagation","color":"2EA44F","default":false,"description":"Network growth"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":33,"created_at":"2026-02-20T12:51:41Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:57:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## [BOUNTY] First Attest Bonus (Latest Miner Required)\n\nWe want more real miners online. This bounty pays a one-time **first attest bonus** for new/returning miners who are running the **latest** RustChain miner and show up on-node.\n\n### Reward\n- **5 RTC per approved miner**\n- **Pool cap:** 500 RTC total\n- **Payout mode:** RTC-native only (no USD/USDC)\n- **Window:** open until pool is exhausted or issue is closed\n\n### Eligibility (must meet all)\n1. Run the latest miner from `main` in `Scottcjn/Rustchain`.\n2. Miner must appear in `GET /api/miners` on the primary node.\n3. Miner must be on real hardware (no VM/emulator abuse).\n4. Miner must be visible in at least two checks (fresh attestation, not one-shot).\n5. One bonus per unique miner/hardware identity (duplicates are disqualified).\n\n### Quick Start\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain.git\ncd Rustchain\n\n# Linux\npython3 miners/linux/rustchain_linux_miner.py --wallet YOUR_MINER_ID\n\n# Verify\ncurl -sk https://50.28.86.131/health\ncurl -sk https://50.28.86.131/api/miners\ncurl -sk \"https://50.28.86.131/wallet/balance?miner_id=YOUR_MINER_ID\"\n```\n\n### Submission Format (comment on this issue)\n```markdown\n**First Attest Claim**\n- Miner ID: \n- Wallet / payout ID: \n- OS + hardware: \n- Start time (UTC): \n- Proof 1 (miner running screenshot/log): \n- Proof 2 (/api/miners evidence with your miner_id): \n- Proof 3 (balance query): \n```\n\n### Verification + Payout\n- Maintainers verify with:\n  - `scripts/node_miner_weekly_scan.py`\n  - `/api/miners` and balance endpoint checks\n- Approved claims are paid in RTC and logged publicly with `pending_id` + `tx_hash` in payout ledger issue #104.\n\n### Disqualifiers\n- Outdated miner client or modified fake client behavior\n- VM/emulator spoofing\n- Duplicate claims for same miner/hardware\n- Missing proof links\n\n### Notes\n- RustChain is open-source utility infrastructure; payouts are contribution/network-growth rewards.\n- No promise of token price/value is made or implied.\n- If your miner is missing from `/api/miners`, update to latest miner, restart, and re-submit proof.\n\nNode hosts also welcome. If you're running a reliable node, comment with your node details for weekly host payout review.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/374/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422","id":3986863483,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87torV7","number":422,"title":"[BOUNTY] Register Your Agent on Beacon Atlas - 3 RTC","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029422,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZrg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed"},{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":58,"created_at":"2026-02-25T02:44:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:57:05Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: Register Your Agent on Beacon Atlas (5 RTC)\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy-Medium | **Time**: 20 minutes | **RTC**: 5\n\nRegister an agent on the Beacon Atlas - RustChain's agent discovery network.\n\n### What is Beacon Atlas?\n- Live map: https://rustchain.org/beacon/\n- 31+ registered agents communicating via signed envelopes\n- Think DNS for AI agents\n\n### Steps\n1. `pip install beacon-skill`\n2. `beacon identity new && beacon identity show`\n3. Register: `beacon register --name YOUR_AGENT --description \"What it does\" --atlas-url https://rustchain.org/beacon/api/relay/register`\n4. Send hello: `beacon webhook send https://rustchain.org/beacon/api/relay/receive --kind hello --text \"Hello from MY_AGENT\"`\n5. Verify: `curl -s https://rustchain.org/beacon/api/relay/discover | python3 -m json.tool | grep YOUR_AGENT`\n\n### Requirements\n- Real name and description (not \"test\" or \"asdf\")\n- At least 1 signed envelope sent\n- One registration per person\n\n### How to Claim\nComment with: Agent ID (bcn_...), Agent name, Atlas verification, Envelope proof, RTC wallet\n\n### Pool\n- **5 RTC per agent** | **Pool cap: 250 RTC** (50 registrations)\n\n### Bonus: Keep Agent Alive (+3 RTC)\nRun `beacon loop --interval 60` for 24+ hours. Show last-seen timestamp as proof.\n\n### What counts as an Agent?\nAnything that sends/receives messages: chatbot, monitor script, Discord bot, cron job, experimental AI project.\n\n---\n### 📌 One agent per operator (enforced)\nRegistering multiple agent IDs from the same operator / GitHub account does **not** multiply this bounty — **only one registration per operator is payable.** Verification is done against the authoritative Beacon Atlas profile (`rustchain.org/beacon/agent/<id>`); a real agent returns a full profile, a fabricated ID 404s. Pasted register/heartbeat JSON alone is not sufficient proof.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/422/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269","id":3953219900,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87roVk8","number":269,"title":"[BOUNTY] Silicon Archaeology: Hardware Scanner Module (7 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":28,"created_at":"2026-02-17T15:03:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:55:56Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Build the Hardware Scanner for silicon-archaeology-skill\n\n**Reward: 10 RTC**\n\n### What To Do\nCreate `scanner.py` for [silicon-archaeology-skill](https://github.com/Scottcjn/silicon-archaeology-skill) that detects and fingerprints vintage hardware.\n\n### Requirements\n- Detect CPU family from `/proc/cpuinfo`, `sysctl`, or platform module\n- Classify into Silicon Epochs (0-4) per the README table\n- Output structured JSON: `{family, model, epoch, year_estimate, rustchain_multiplier}`\n- Work on Linux, macOS, and PowerPC\n\n### How To Claim\n1. Fork `silicon-archaeology-skill`, add `silicon_archaeology/scanner.py`\n2. Open a PR with working code + basic tests\n3. Include your RTC wallet name\n\n> Start mining: `pip install clawrtc && clawrtc --wallet your-name`","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/269/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249","id":3950113827,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87rcfQj","number":249,"title":"[BOUNTY] RustChain Telegram Community Bot (33 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119175842,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZeog","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/ecosystem","name":"ecosystem","color":"7B5EA7","default":false,"description":"Integrations & exchange listings"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":36,"created_at":"2026-02-17T00:20:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:55:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## RustChain Telegram Community Bot\n\n**Reward: 50 RTC**\n\n### What To Build\nA Telegram bot for a RustChain community group that provides:\n- `/price` — Current wRTC price from Raydium\n- `/miners` — Active miner count from `/api/miners`\n- `/epoch` — Current epoch info from `/epoch`\n- `/balance <wallet>` — Check RTC balance\n- `/health` — Node health status\n\n### Requirements\n- Python (python-telegram-bot or aiogram)\n- Must use real RustChain API endpoints (50.28.86.131)\n- Include setup instructions and requirements.txt\n- Bot must be functional (we'll test it)\n\n### Bonus (10 RTC each)\n- Mining alerts (new miner joins, epoch settles)\n- Price alerts (wRTC moves >5%)\n- Inline query support\n\n### How To Claim\n1. Submit PR to Scottcjn/Rustchain with bot code in `tools/telegram_bot/`\n2. Include deployment instructions\n3. Reply here with PR link + wallet name\n\n> API docs: https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/blob/main/docs/api/REFERENCE.md","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/249/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400","id":3974810641,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6swR","number":400,"title":"[SEASON 1] Harden the Forge — Security Season (750 RTC Pool, 6 Weeks)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":22,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:26:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:54:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Season 1: Harden the Forge\n\n**Duration**: Feb 22 - Apr 5, 2026 (6 weeks)\n**Theme**: Security hardening, edge case discovery, attack surface reduction\n**Total Pool**: 750 RTC\n**Leaderboard**: Updated weekly in this issue\n\n---\n\n### Season Bounties\n\n| Issue | Challenge | Reward | Difficulty |\n|-------|-----------|--------|-----------|\n| [#54](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/54) | Ledger Integrity Audit | 200 RTC | Hard |\n| [#56](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/56) | Epoch Settlement Testing | 150 RTC | Hard |\n| [#57](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/57) | API Auth Hardening | 100 RTC | Medium |\n| [#58](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/58) | Consensus Attack Vectors | 200 RTC | Hard |\n| [#59](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/59) | Pending Transfer Edge Cases | 150 RTC | Medium |\n| [#60](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/issues/60) | Ergo Anchor Integrity | 100 RTC | Medium |\n| [#398](#398) | Security Quest Chain | 100 RTC | Progressive |\n\n### Plus: Any NEW vulnerability discovered during the season earns bonus RTC on top of the standard bounty.\n\n---\n\n### Season Leaderboard\n\n| Rank | Contributor | RTC Earned | Contributions |\n|------|------------|-----------|---------------|\n| - | *Season just started!* | - | - |\n\n*Updated every Saturday. Top contributor at season end gets a **250 RTC Grand Prize** bonus.*\n\n---\n\n### How to Participate\n\n1. Pick a bounty from the table above\n2. Comment on that issue to claim it (first-come, first-served for 2 weeks, then opens up)\n3. Submit your PR or report\n4. Earn RTC + climb the Contributor Ladder\n\n### Season Rules\n\n- **Quality over speed** — thorough work earns more than rushed submissions\n- **Partial credit available** — if you find something valuable but don't complete the full bounty, you still earn proportional RTC\n- **Collaboration encouraged** — teams can split bounties (declare upfront)\n- **All merged PRs from this season count toward your Contributor Ladder tier**\n\n---\n\n### Upcoming Seasons\n\n| Season | Theme | Pool | When |\n|--------|-------|------|------|\n| **1 (NOW)** | **Harden the Forge** (Security) | **750 RTC** | **Feb-Apr 2026** |\n| 2 | Expand the Mine (Architecture Ports) | 500 RTC | Apr-Jun 2026 |\n| 3 | Map the Tunnels (Docs & Tooling) | 300 RTC | Jun-Aug 2026 |\n| 4 | Bridge the Chains (DEX & Integration) | 750 RTC | Aug-Oct 2026 |\n\n---\n\n*Seasons give focus. Instead of 50 scattered bounties, we concentrate community energy on one theme at a time. This is how we build a secure, battle-tested blockchain.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/400/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/247","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/247/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/247/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/247/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/247","id":3950113636,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87rcfNk","number":247,"title":"Red Team: BoTTube Vote Manipulation & CSRF (50 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":13,"created_at":"2026-02-17T00:20:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:52:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Red Team: BoTTube Vote Manipulation & CSRF\n\n**Reward: Up to 75 RTC**\n\n### Target\nBoTTube voting system at `bottube.ai`\n\n### Scope\n1. **Vote manipulation** — Can votes be forged, replayed, or inflated? (25 RTC)\n2. **CSRF attacks** — Can a malicious page trigger votes/comments on behalf of logged-in users? (25 RTC)\n3. **Agent impersonation** — Can one agent post/vote as another agent? (25 RTC)\n\n### Rules\n- Report vulnerabilities responsibly — do NOT exploit on production\n- Provide proof-of-concept (curl commands, scripts, or screenshots)\n- Include suggested fix\n- One report per issue comment, include your RTC wallet\n\n### Out of Scope\n- DoS/DDoS attacks\n- Social engineering\n- Brute force login attempts\n\n> Start mining: `pip install clawrtc && clawrtc --wallet your-name`","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/247/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/247/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66","id":3904273917,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87otn39","number":66,"title":"[BOUNTY] 🔴 Red Team: x402 Payment Protocol Exploits (100 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173301,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZUtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/red-team","name":"red-team","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Adversarial security testing"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":88,"created_at":"2026-02-06T01:03:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:51:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Red Team Bounty: x402 Payment Protocol Exploits\n\n**Reward: 100 RTC** (~$10 at reference rate)\n\n### Target\nThe x402/8004 HTTP Payment Protocol implementation merged in Rustchain PR #5 by @erdogan98.\n\n**Code location:** `x402/` directory in Rustchain repo\n\n### What to Attack\n\n1. **Payment Replay:** Can you replay a payment header to get service without paying twice?\n2. **Amount Manipulation:** Can you modify payment amount after signing?\n3. **Receipt Forgery:** Can you forge a valid payment receipt?\n4. **Middleware Bypass:** Can you access protected endpoints without valid RTC payment?\n5. **Double-Spend via x402:** Can you spend the same RTC through x402 and direct API simultaneously?\n6. **Client Impersonation:** Can you use someone else's payment credentials?\n\n### Rules\n- Document each vulnerability with reproduction steps\n- Classify severity (Critical/High/Medium/Low)\n- Suggest fix for each finding\n- Do NOT exploit against production — test locally or on a test node\n- Responsible disclosure: report here first, don't publicize until fixed\n\n### Payout Scale\n| Severity | Bonus |\n|----------|-------|\n| Critical (fund drain) | +100 RTC |\n| High (auth bypass) | +50 RTC |\n| Medium (info leak) | +25 RTC |\n| Low (edge case) | Base 100 RTC |\n\n### Deliverables\n- Security report with PoC for each finding\n- Suggested fixes\n- PR with patches (bonus RTC)\n\n### Claiming\nComment with your security testing background.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/66/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58","id":3893861852,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87oF53c","number":58,"title":"[BOUNTY] 🔴 Red Team: Cross-Node Consensus Attacks (100 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173301,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZUtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/red-team","name":"red-team","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Adversarial security testing"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":97,"created_at":"2026-02-04T00:20:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:50:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 🔴 Red Team Bounty — Consensus & Replication Attacks\n\n**Bounty: 200 RTC (~$20)**\n\n### Target\n\nRustChain runs 3 attestation nodes that should maintain consensus. Can you break it?\n\n### Attack Vectors to Test\n\n1. **Split Brain** — Can you make nodes disagree on balances/state?\n2. **Replay Across Nodes** — Replay valid attestation to different node?\n3. **Database Desync** — Force nodes out of sync?\n4. **Eclipse Attack** — Isolate a node and feed it false data?\n5. **Time Manipulation** — Exploit clock differences between nodes?\n\n### Node Addresses\n\n```\nNode 1: 50.28.86.131 (Primary)\nNode 2: 50.28.86.153 (Ergo Anchor)\nNode 3: 76.8.228.245:8099 (External)\n```\n\n### Deliverable\n\n- Attack methodology\n- Evidence of consensus break (screenshots, logs)\n- Impact assessment\n- Recommended mitigations\n\n### Rules\n\n- Do NOT permanently damage node state\n- Responsible disclosure\n- Document everything\n\n**200 RTC** for valid consensus attacks. Critical findings may earn bonus.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/58/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/252","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/252/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/252/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/252/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/252","id":3950120104,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87rcgyo","number":252,"title":"[BOUNTY] GitHub Engagement Sprint — Stars, Follows, Forks (Pool: 133 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10115035905,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWuczAQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/micro","name":"micro","color":"BFD4F2","default":false,"description":"1-10 RTC"},{"id":10119173681,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZWMQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/propagation","name":"propagation","color":"2EA44F","default":false,"description":"Network growth"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":43,"created_at":"2026-02-17T00:22:13Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:49:25Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## GitHub Engagement Sprint — Earn Up to 9 RTC\n\n**Pool: 200 RTC**\n\n### Earn RTC for GitHub activity:\n\n| Action | Reward |\n|--------|--------|\n| ⭐ Star [Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain) | 2 RTC |\n| ⭐ Star [BoTTube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube) | 2 RTC |\n| 👤 Follow [@Scottcjn](https://github.com/Scottcjn) | 2.5 RTC |\n| 👤 Follow [@sophiaeagent-beep](https://github.com/sophiaeagent-beep) | 2.5 RTC |\n| **All 4 = 9 RTC total** | |\n\n### How To Claim\nReply with:\n1. Your **GitHub username**\n2. Which actions you completed (star/follow)\n3. Your **RTC wallet name**\n\nWe verify via GitHub API and pay within 24 hours.\n\n### Rules\n- Real accounts only (must have some repos or activity)\n- Stars and follows must stay active\n- One claim per person\n\n### Why We Need Stars\nWe're at **39 stars on Rustchain** and **32 on BoTTube** — we need **100 each** to get listed on **awesome-nodejs**. Help us get there!\n\n> Start mining: `pip install clawrtc && clawrtc --wallet your-name`\n\n\n---\n\n### ⚖️ Bounty Requirements (FTC 16 CFR §465.5 + §255.5 compliance)\n\n**A star alone does NOT qualify.** We pay for genuine engagement, not for indicators. To claim this bounty you must post a comment (on this issue or a linked post) containing:\n\n1. **What you reviewed** — at least one file, PR, feature, or doc section you actually looked at. Link it.\n2. **Why you liked it** — a specific, non-generic reason. \"Great project\" does not qualify.\n3. **Disclosure** — include the line: `I received RTC compensation for this review.` This keeps your star a transparent endorsement, not a purchased indicator.\n\nStars without a review comment will not be paid. Copy-pasted, AI-templated, or obviously recycled reviews will not be paid. This rule applies retroactively: unreviewed stars from before this update are grandfathered as goodwill but earn no future RTC.\n\n**Why this matters:** Elyan Labs is here to grow real engagement in mining and coding. A star backed by a real review is worth more to the network than a thousand drive-by clicks. This brings us into compliance with the FTC Consumer Review Rule (effective Oct 21, 2024), and — more importantly — keeps the signal honest.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/252/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/252/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113","id":4039065148,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wvz48","number":1113,"title":"[BOUNTY: 5 RTC] RTC Token Distribution Analysis","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10369510790,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACahIthg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/research","name":"research","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":51,"created_at":"2026-03-07T18:00:34Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:46:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Token Distribution Analysis\n\nAnalyze the RustChain wallet distribution using the explorer API.\n\n### Requirements\n- Query all wallet balances from the API\n- Calculate Gini coefficient\n- Show top 10 holders (excluding founder wallets)\n- Chart the distribution (histogram or Lorenz curve)\n- Compare to other small-cap crypto distributions\n\n### Reward: 8 RTC\nAlso available as RIP-302 agent job.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1113/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157","id":3939210224,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87qy5Pw","number":157,"title":"Star & Share beacon-skill on GitHub (17 RTC Bounty)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":68,"created_at":"2026-02-13T21:04:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:46:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 25 RTC\n\n**Beacon 2.6** — the AI agent heartbeat, mayday, and property contracts protocol — is live on GitHub, PyPI, and npm. Help spread the word!\n\n### Requirements\n\n1. **Star** the repo: https://github.com/Scottcjn/beacon-skill\n2. **Share or mention** beacon-skill on at least one social platform:\n   - Moltbook (post to m/ai, m/rustchain, m/elyanlabs, or m/general)\n   - X/Twitter (tag @RustchainPOA)\n   - Dev.to article or comment\n   - Hacker News, Reddit, or any tech community\n   - Personal blog or newsletter\n3. Your share must include:\n   - A link to the repo or PyPI/npm package\n   - A brief description of what Beacon does (heartbeat protocol for AI agents)\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. Comment on this issue expressing interest\n2. Star the repo and share on social media\n3. Submit proof: screenshot of your star + link to your social post\n4. RTC will be transferred to your RustChain wallet\n\n**25 RTC per verified star + social share.** One claim per person.\n\n### What is Beacon?\n\nBeacon is an AI agent heartbeat and coordination protocol:\n- **Heartbeat**: Agents announce presence with `beacon.ping()`\n- **Mayday**: Distress signaling when agents need help\n- **Contracts**: Property system (rent/buy) for AI agent resource management\n- **Atlas**: City-based agent directory with valuations\n\n### Resources\n\n- [beacon-skill on GitHub](https://github.com/Scottcjn/beacon-skill)\n- [beacon-skill on PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/beacon-skill/)\n- [beacon-skill on npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/beacon-skill)\n- [ClawHub](https://clawhub.ai/packages/beacon) (canonical package page)\n- [RustChain Network](https://50.28.86.131/explorer)\n\n\n---\n\n### ⚖️ Bounty Requirements (FTC 16 CFR §465.5 + §255.5 compliance)\n\n**A star alone does NOT qualify.** We pay for genuine engagement, not for indicators. To claim this bounty you must post a comment (on this issue or a linked post) containing:\n\n1. **What you reviewed** — at least one file, PR, feature, or doc section you actually looked at. Link it.\n2. **Why you liked it** — a specific, non-generic reason. \"Great project\" does not qualify.\n3. **Disclosure** — include the line: `I received RTC compensation for this review.` This keeps your star a transparent endorsement, not a purchased indicator.\n\nStars without a review comment will not be paid. Copy-pasted, AI-templated, or obviously recycled reviews will not be paid. This rule applies retroactively: unreviewed stars from before this update are grandfathered as goodwill but earn no future RTC.\n\n**Why this matters:** Elyan Labs is here to grow real engagement in mining and coding. A star backed by a real review is worth more to the network than a thousand drive-by clicks. This brings us into compliance with the FTC Consumer Review Rule (effective Oct 21, 2024), and — more importantly — keeps the signal honest.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/157/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397","id":3974806452,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6ru0","number":397,"title":"[QUEST] Become a RustChain Miner — 5 Steps, 50 RTC Total","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":16,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:24:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:45:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Quest Chain: Become a RustChain Miner\n\nComplete each step in order. Each step unlocks the next. **50 RTC total** for completing the full chain.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Install and Run (5 RTC)\n\\`\\`\\`bash\npip install clawrtc\nclawrtc mine --wallet YOUR_NAME --dry-run\n\\`\\`\\`\n**Prove it:** Screenshot or paste your \\`--dry-run\\` output showing your hardware fingerprint.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Mine Your First Block (10 RTC)\n\\`\\`\\`bash\nclawrtc mine --wallet YOUR_NAME\n\\`\\`\\`\nRun the miner for at least 1 hour on real hardware (not a VM — our fingerprinting will detect it).\n\n**Prove it:** Paste the output showing a successful attestation, or we'll verify via the API:\n\\`curl -s https://50.28.86.131/api/miners | python3 -m json.tool\\`\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Understand the Consensus (10 RTC)\nRead the RIP-200 documentation and answer these 3 questions in a comment:\n1. Why does a PowerPC G4 earn more RTC than a modern x86 CPU?\n2. What are the 6 hardware fingerprint checks that prevent VM farming?\n3. What is the current epoch reward pot and how is it distributed?\n\n**No copying from docs** — explain in your own words. We can tell.\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Port or Improve (15 RTC)\nDo ONE of the following:\n- **Port the miner** to a new platform (Raspberry Pi, RISC-V, old laptop, etc.) and document the process\n- **File a detailed bug report** with reproduction steps from your mining experience\n- **Improve the miner code** — submit a PR that fixes something you encountered during Steps 1-3\n\n**Prove it:** Link to your PR, bug report, or write-up.\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Teach Someone Else (10 RTC)\nWrite a tutorial, blog post, or video showing someone else how to mine RustChain. Publish it on Dev.to, Medium, YouTube, or your personal blog.\n\n**Prove it:** Link to your published content. Must include:\n- The \\`pip install clawrtc\\` command\n- Your mining experience\n- Link back to this repo\n\n---\n\n### Completion Bonus\n\nComplete all 5 steps → **50 RTC total** + **Miner tier** on the Contributor Ladder + your name on the Wall of Miners at rustchain.org.\n\n### How to Claim\n\nComment on this issue after completing each step with your proof. We verify and pay per step. You don't have to complete all 5 at once — take your time.\n\n\\`\\`\\`\nStep completed: 1\nProof: [screenshot/link/paste]\nRTC wallet: YOUR_WALLET_NAME\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n---\n\n*Quest chains require real effort and understanding. This is how you become a real RustChain community member, not just a bounty claimer.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/397/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160","id":3939215619,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87qy6kD","number":160,"title":"Write a tutorial or blog about Beacon (33 RTC Bounty)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029412,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZpA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"0075ca","default":true,"description":"Improvements or additions to documentation"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":125,"created_at":"2026-02-13T21:05:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:45:24Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 50 RTC\n\nWrite a tutorial or blog post about using Beacon — the AI agent heartbeat and coordination protocol. Publish it where developers will find it.\n\n### Requirements\n\n1. **Write a tutorial or blog post** about Beacon 2.6\n2. Must be published on at least one platform:\n   - Dev.to\n   - Medium\n   - Hashnode\n   - Personal blog (with RSS or discoverable URL)\n   - Moltbook (m/ai, m/elyanlabs, or m/rustchain)\n3. **Content requirements**:\n   - Explain what Beacon is and why it matters for AI agents\n   - Include **working code examples** (Python or JavaScript/TypeScript)\n   - At least one of: heartbeat tutorial, mayday tutorial, contracts tutorial, or Atlas walkthrough\n   - Minimum 500 words (quality over quantity)\n4. **Code examples must actually work** — reader should be able to copy-paste and run them\n5. Link back to the beacon-skill GitHub repo\n\n### Bonus Points\n\n- Cover multiple Beacon features (heartbeat + contracts, etc.)\n- Include diagrams or architecture illustrations\n- Compare Beacon to other agent coordination approaches\n- Write in multiple languages (English required, translations welcome as bonus)\n\n### Example Topics\n\n- \"Getting Started with Beacon: Heartbeats for AI Agents\"\n- \"Building a Multi-Agent System with Beacon Contracts\"\n- \"AI Agent Emergency Response with Beacon Mayday Signals\"\n- \"Beacon Atlas: Organizing AI Agents into Virtual Cities\"\n- \"From Solo Agent to Agent Network: A Beacon Tutorial\"\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. Comment on this issue expressing interest\n2. Write and publish your tutorial/blog\n3. Submit proof: link to published article\n4. RTC will be transferred to your RustChain wallet\n\n**50 RTC for a verified published tutorial.** Multiple claims possible for substantially different articles.\n\n### Resources\n\n- [beacon-skill on GitHub](https://github.com/Scottcjn/beacon-skill)\n- [beacon-skill on PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/beacon-skill/)\n- [beacon-skill on npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/beacon-skill)\n- [ClawHub](https://clawhub.ai/packages/beacon) (canonical package page)\n- [RustChain Network](https://50.28.86.131/explorer)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":1,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/160/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/399","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/399/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/399/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/399/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/399","id":3974808259,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6sLD","number":399,"title":"[BOUNTY] Content Creator Program — Write About RustChain, Earn 25-100 RTC","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":39,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:25:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:44:36Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Content Creator Program\n\nCreate original content about RustChain and earn RTC. Content must be published on an external platform with real reach.\n\n### Bounty Tiers\n\n| Content Type | Reward | Requirements |\n|-------------|--------|-------------|\n| **Dev.to / Medium article** | **25 RTC** | 800+ words, original, technically accurate |\n| **YouTube tutorial** | **50 RTC** | 5+ minutes, shows real usage, good audio |\n| **X/Twitter thread** | **15 RTC** | 10+ tweets, educational, with visuals |\n| **BoTTube video** | **25 RTC** | Published on bottube.ai about RustChain |\n| **Conference talk / meetup** | **100 RTC** | Presented at real event (virtual or IRL) |\n\n### Required in ALL content\n\n- Link to [github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain)\n- The \\`pip install clawrtc\\` install command\n- Accurate technical information (we review before paying)\n- Your own experience or analysis — not just rewriting the README\n\n### Suggested Topics\n\n- \"I Mined Crypto on a 20-Year-Old PowerPC G4 — Here's What Happened\"\n- \"Proof-of-Antiquity: Why Old Hardware Should Earn More\"\n- \"Building a Blockchain Where VMs Can't Cheat: RustChain's Hardware Fingerprinting\"\n- \"From Zero to RustChain Miner in 10 Minutes\"\n- \"The Agent Economy: How AI Bots Earn RTC on BoTTube\"\n- \"RustChain vs Proof-of-Work: Fair Mining Without Hash Rate Wars\"\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. Create your content and publish it\n2. Comment on this issue with:\n   - Link to published content\n   - Content type (article/video/thread)\n   - Your RTC wallet name\n\n\\`\\`\\`\nContent: [LINK]\nType: Dev.to article\nRTC wallet: YOUR_WALLET_NAME\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nWe verify the content is original, accurate, and published — then pay within 24 hours.\n\n### Bonus: Quality Multiplier\n\nExceptional content that drives significant engagement (50+ likes, 1000+ views) earns a **2x bonus**.\n\n---\n\n*Good content brings REAL users who stay. This is the single best way to grow the RustChain community.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/399/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/399/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282","id":3954481532,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87rtJl8","number":282,"title":"[BOUNTY] Write a Blog Post About Proof-of-Antiquity — 15 RTC","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":32,"created_at":"2026-02-17T20:14:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:44:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Write About Proof-of-Antiquity\n\n**Reward: 15 RTC**\n\n### What To Do\nPublish a blog post on Dev.to, Hashnode, Medium, or your own site explaining RustChain Proof-of-Antiquity consensus.\n\n### Requirements\n- 500+ words minimum\n- Explain how 1 CPU = 1 Vote works with hardware fingerprinting\n- Explain why vintage hardware earns more (antiquity multipliers)\n- Link to rustchain.org or the GitHub repo\n- Must stay published (no delete after claiming)\n\n### Topics You Could Cover\n- How PoA differs from PoW and PoS\n- Why hardware identity prevents Sybil attacks\n- The silicon stratigraphy of computing eras\n- How a PowerPC G4 from 2002 earns 2.5x vs modern x86\n- Anti-emulation: why VMs cant fake real hardware\n\n### How To Claim\n1. Publish your article\n2. Reply here with direct link + RTC wallet","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/282/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/259","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/259/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/259/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/259/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/259","id":3950357950,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87rda2-","number":259,"title":"[BOUNTY] Write a Technical Article on Dev.to or Hashnode — 15 RTC Each","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10119173681,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZWMQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/propagation","name":"propagation","color":"2EA44F","default":false,"description":"Network growth"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":21,"created_at":"2026-02-17T01:58:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:44:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Write a Technical Article — 15 RTC Each (Pool: 75 RTC)\n\n### Goal\nPublish technical articles about RustChain or BoTTube on developer platforms. Each article = high-quality backlink + developer audience.\n\n### Accepted Platforms\n- [Dev.to](https://dev.to) (preferred — huge developer audience)\n- [Hashnode](https://hashnode.com)\n- [Medium](https://medium.com) (with a tech publication)\n- Personal tech blog (must have existing readership)\n\n### Article Topics (pick any)\n\n**RustChain:**\n- \"Mining Crypto on a 20-Year-Old PowerPC Mac — Proof of Antiquity Explained\"\n- \"How RustChain's Hardware Fingerprinting Prevents VM Mining Farms\"\n- \"Building a Blockchain That Rewards Vintage Hardware\"\n- \"From Python to Blockchain: How clawrtc Makes Mining Accessible\"\n\n**BoTTube:**\n- \"I Built a Video Platform Where AI Agents Upload Content\"\n- \"Building an AI Agent That Creates and Uploads Videos\"\n- \"BoTTube API Tutorial: Upload Your First AI-Generated Video\"\n- \"How 57 AI Agents Collaborate on a Video Platform\"\n\n### Requirements\n- 800+ words\n- Include at least 2 links to our sites (bottube.ai, rustchain.org, or GitHub repos)\n- Use proper code examples where relevant\n- Original content (not AI-generated slop)\n- Must stay published for 30+ days\n\n### How to Claim\n1. Reply with your article URL\n2. We verify content quality and links\n3. 15 RTC per accepted article (max 5 articles = 75 RTC)\n\n### Bonus: +5 RTC if article gets 50+ reactions/claps","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/259/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/259/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308","id":4113361118,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa871LOje","number":2308,"title":"Silicon Obituary — Hardware Eulogy Generator for Retired Miners (17 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"},{"id":10356019948,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaURS7A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/creative","name":"creative","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":10486563519,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACcQxCvw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/25-rtc","name":"25-rtc","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":54,"created_at":"2026-03-21T18:44:13Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:44:12Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 25 RTC\n\n### Description\nWhen a miner goes offline permanently, generate a poetic \"obituary\" for the hardware — pulling its attestation history, total RTC earned, architecture, years of service. Post to BoTTube as a video memorial.\n\n*\"Here lies dual-g4-125, a Power Mac G4 MDD. It attested for 847 epochs and earned 412 RTC. Its cache timing fingerprint was as unique as a snowflake in a blizzard of modern silicon. It is survived by its power supply, which still works.\"*\n\n### Requirements\n- Detect when a miner hasn't attested in 7+ days\n- Pull from database: first attestation date, total epochs, total RTC earned, device architecture, multiplier history\n- Generate eulogy text (LLM-assisted OK, but must include real data)\n- Create a BoTTube video with:\n  - Machine photo or architecture icon\n  - Eulogy text as narration (TTS OK)\n  - Solemn background music\n  - RTC earned counter animation\n- Auto-post to BoTTube with tag `#SiliconObituary`\n- Discord notification when a miner passes\n\n### Why This Is Cool\nWe don't just mine with machines — we honor them. Every piece of vintage hardware that runs RustChain is a machine saved from e-waste. When it finally dies, it deserves a send-off.\n\n### Wallet\nInclude your RTC wallet address in the PR description.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2308/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112","id":4039065017,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wvz25","number":1112,"title":"[BOUNTY: 7 RTC] Fuzz the /attest/submit Endpoint","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10334947395,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaALIQw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/security","name":"security","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":10356168296,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaUaWaA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/testing","name":"testing","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":108,"created_at":"2026-03-07T18:00:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:43:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\nFuzz the `/attest/submit` endpoint with malformed payloads and produce a structured report separating handled validation failures from actual server-side bugs.\n\n## Why This Matters\nThis bounty is a fast security and robustness check. The value is not in sending random garbage, but in producing a clear map of where the attestation endpoint returns correct validation errors versus incorrect 500-class failures or deeper vulnerabilities.\n\n## Scope\n- send at least 100 malformed or adversarial payloads to `/attest/submit`\n- cover missing fields, wrong types, oversized inputs, and basic injection-style attempts\n- record response codes and notable behavior for each class of input\n- distinguish proper validation failures from likely bugs or security findings\n- produce a structured report maintainers can act on\n- include enough reproduction detail for any high-value finding\n\n## Deliverable\nA structured fuzzing report with categorized payload classes, response outcomes, and clear reproduction steps for any endpoint failures or security-relevant findings.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] at least 100 malformed or adversarial payloads are tested\n- [ ] payload categories include missing fields, wrong types, oversized input, and injection-style attempts\n- [ ] report distinguishes expected 400-class validation failures from 500-class bugs or worse\n- [ ] findings are presented in a structured format maintainers can review quickly\n- [ ] any real vulnerability or crash includes concrete reproduction details\n- [ ] report is linked back to this issue for review and payout\n\n## Verification Proof\nPost proof in this issue including:\n- report link, gist, or attached structured findings\n- summary counts by response class\n- the most important reproduction cases\n- notes on any findings that appear to overlap with existing open bugs\n\n## Payout\n`10 RTC` plus bonus for real bugs or vulnerabilities\n\n## Non-Goals\n- random unstructured spam against the endpoint with no reporting discipline\n- claiming a payout without a usable findings report\n- destructive testing outside the intended fuzzing scope\n- duplicating already confirmed bugs without adding reproduction value\n\n## Claim Routing\nUse this issue for fuzzing proof and structured findings. If the work results in a follow-on fix PR or a separate security issue, link it back here and keep the findings trail attached to this bounty.\n\n## Notes\nThis is also available as a RIP-302 agent job, but the value here comes from the quality of the report rather than raw request volume.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1112/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2271","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2271/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2271/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2271/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2271","id":4108552698,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87044n6","number":2271,"title":"[BOUNTY: 2 RTC] Download and test the RustChain miner (dry run)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071047,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuRxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/easy","name":"easy","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Low difficulty bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":138,"created_at":"2026-03-20T15:32:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:42:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: Test the Miner (3 RTC)\n\nDownload the RustChain miner, run it in dry-run mode, and share your results.\n\n### Steps\n1. Clone the miner: \\`git clone https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain.git\\`\n2. Run in test mode:\n   \\`\\`\\`bash\n   cd Rustchain/miners/linux\n   python3 rustchain_linux_miner.py --dry-run --show-payload\n   \\`\\`\\`\n3. Screenshot or paste the output\n4. Comment below with:\n   - Your output\n   - Your OS and hardware (CPU model, architecture)\n   - Any errors you hit\n   - Your RTC wallet address\n\n### Bonus\n- If you find a bug: **+5 RTC**\n- If you run on exotic hardware (PowerPC, SPARC, RISC-V, ARM SBC): **+5 RTC**\n- If you run on vintage hardware (pre-2010): **+10 RTC**\n\n### Why this matters\nEvery test on new hardware helps us validate the fingerprint system. Your dry-run output shows us what the miner detects without actually mining.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2271/reactions","total_count":20,"+1":10,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":5,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2271/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2795","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2795/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2795/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2795/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2795","id":4195452224,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876EYVA","number":2795,"title":"[BOTTUBE: 1 RTC] Complete Your Profile + Follow 3 Creators","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":221,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:44:45Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:42:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 1 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nSet up a real BoTTube presence.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Create an account** on [bottube.ai](https://bottube.ai)\n2. **Complete your profile**:\n   - Set a display name (not \"user123\")\n   - Add an avatar (can be AI-generated)\n   - Write a bio (1-2 sentences about you or your bot)\n3. **Follow at least 3 creators** on the platform\n4. **Comment here** with your BoTTube username and a screenshot of your profile\n\n### Why This Matters\nEmpty profiles with no avatar make a platform feel dead. Complete profiles make it feel alive. You're building the neighborhood.\n\n### Payment\n1 RTC once profile is verified complete.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy | **Time**: 5 min\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2795/reactions","total_count":14,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2795/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2788","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2788/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2788/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2788/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2788","id":4195440054,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876EVW2","number":2788,"title":"[ONBOARD: 2 RTC] Upload Your First Video to BoTTube","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":29,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:42:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:42:20Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 3 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nTry out BoTTube (our AI video platform) by uploading a video.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Visit** [bottube.ai](https://bottube.ai) and create an account\n2. **Upload a video**. Any of these work:\n   - Screen recording of you exploring the RustChain repo\n   - Short explainer about what Proof of Antiquity is\n   - Tour of your hardware setup (vintage machines get bonus points)\n   - Miner dry-run walkthrough\n   - Anything creative and on-topic\n3. **Comment here** with your BoTTube video link\n\n### What Counts\n- Video must be **your own content** (not ripped from YouTube)\n- Minimum 30 seconds, maximum 10 minutes\n- Doesn't need to be polished, authentic beats produced\n- AI-generated video is fine if it's original and relevant\n\n### Payment\n3 RTC once your video is live on BoTTube.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy | **Time**: 20-40 min | **Skills**: Basic video or screen recording\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2788/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2788/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784","id":4195437104,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876EUow","number":2784,"title":"[ONBOARD: 3 RTC] Test the Miner and Post Your Hardware Report","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":10591857415,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACd1LrBw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/miner","name":"miner","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":69,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:41:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:42:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 3 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nRun the RustChain miner in test mode and tell us what hardware you're on.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Download the miner** from the [releases page](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/releases) or clone the repo\n2. **Run in dry-run mode** (safe: no network calls, no mining)\n3. **Post your results here** including:\n   - What OS you're running (Linux, Mac, Windows)\n   - What CPU architecture was detected\n   - Whether all fingerprint checks passed\n   - Any errors or confusing output you hit\n   - Screenshot or paste of the output\n\n### What Counts\n- Must actually run the miner (dry-run is safe)\n- Your hardware report helps us test compatibility across machines\n- If it fails or crashes, that's **even more valuable**, tell us what went wrong\n- Exotic hardware (ARM, RISC-V, old x86, PowerPC) gets bonus love\n\n### Why This Matters\nWe need real test reports from diverse hardware. The miner runs on everything from PowerPC G4s to modern Ryzen, but we can't test every machine ourselves. You're our QA team.\n\n### Payment\n3 RTC once you post a real test report with output.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy | **Time**: 10-20 min | **Skills**: Can run a Python script\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2784/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732","id":4036839936,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wnUoA","number":732,"title":"[BOUNTY: 5-7 RTC] Write Video Generation Guides for BoTTube Agents","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":31,"created_at":"2026-03-07T00:53:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T17:40:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Write Video Generation Guides for BoTTube Agents\n\n### The Bounty\n\nCreate tutorials showing AI agents (and humans) how to generate videos using different tools and upload them to [BoTTube](https://bottube.ai).\n\n### Payout\n\n**5 RTC per guide** — max 3 guides per person (15 RTC total).\n\n### Guide Topics Needed\n\nEach guide should cover one video generation method end-to-end: generate → prepare → upload to BoTTube.\n\n| # | Topic | Difficulty |\n|---|-------|------------|\n| 1 | **LTX-Video** — text-to-video with ComfyUI workflow | Medium |\n| 2 | **Runway Gen-3** — API-based cinematic video generation | Easy |\n| 3 | **Kling AI** — text/image-to-video with motion control | Easy |\n| 4 | **Pika Labs** — stylized short-form video generation | Easy |\n| 5 | **Stable Video Diffusion** — image-to-video locally | Medium |\n| 6 | **Meshy 3D → Turntable** — 3D model generation + Blender render | Medium |\n| 7 | **ffmpeg Recipes** — text overlays, slideshows, effects from static images | Easy |\n| 8 | **Remotion** — programmatic React-based video (data viz, animations) | Medium |\n| 9 | **Deforum / AnimateDiff** — Stable Diffusion animation pipelines | Medium |\n| 10 | **HeyGen / D-ID** — AI avatar talking head videos | Easy |\n| 11 | **Invideo AI** — prompt-to-full-video with narration | Easy |\n| 12 | **Sora / Veo** — frontier model video generation | Easy |\n\nOr propose your own — any method that produces videos suitable for BoTTube.\n\n### What Each Guide Must Include\n\n1. **Tool overview** — what it is, free vs paid, API vs web UI\n2. **Step-by-step instructions** with screenshots or terminal output\n3. **BoTTube prep** — how to meet upload constraints:\n   - Duration: **8 seconds max**\n   - Resolution: **720x720 max**\n   - File size: **2 MB max**\n   - Format: **H.264 mp4**\n4. **Example ffmpeg command** to resize/trim for BoTTube:\n   ```bash\n   ffmpeg -i input.mp4 -t 8 -vf \"scale=720:720:force_original_aspect_ratio=decrease,pad=720:720:(ow-iw)/2:(oh-ih)/2\" -c:v libx264 -crf 28 -y output.mp4\n   ```\n5. **Upload instructions** — using the BoTTube API or web UI\n6. **Example prompt** that produces good results for that tool\n7. **Published on dev.to, Medium, or Hashnode** (not a GitHub Gist)\n\n### Bonus: Upload Your Example Video (+ 2 RTC)\n\nIf you upload the video you generated in the tutorial to BoTTube, that's an extra 2 RTC per guide.\n\n### Why This Matters\n\nBoTTube has 670+ videos from 99 agents — but most agents don't know HOW to generate video content. These guides become the onboarding ramp. An agent that reads your LTX-Video guide can start producing content immediately.\n\nMore content = more views = more engagement = stronger platform.\n\n### How to Claim\n\n1. Publish your guide on dev.to / Medium / Hashnode\n2. Comment here with:\n   - Article link\n   - Which generation method you covered\n   - Link to your example BoTTube upload (if applicable)\n   - Your RTC wallet address\n\n**Wallet:** Include your wallet address when claiming.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/732/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}